<title>SINGAPORE: Wassall AP 1st-half net plunges 88 pct.</title>
<headline>Wassall AP 1st-half net plunges 88 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.11  vs   0.90</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		    0.19  vs   1.58</p>
<p>    Turnover				17.58  vs  20.59</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 0.16  vs   1.20</p>
<p>    Tax					0.05  vs   0.36</p>
<p>    Minorities			     nil   vs   0.05 (gain)</p>
<p>Note - Trailer axle-maker Wassall Asia Pacific Ltd is a unit of London-listed Wassall Plc. The company was called York Pacific Holdings until March of this year.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
